  "description": "A validation library for Blazor using rules instead of attributes.\n\t\t\tSupports complex models, sub-models, and collections.\n\n\t\t\tThe main classes are:\n\t\t\t* ModelValidator - Inherit from this to create rules for a model\n\t\t\t* GenericModelValidator - The same as above, but allows specifying a custom type for the ValidationContext and RuleResult\n\t\t\t* ValidatorComponent - Place this in an EditForm and pass a validator to validate the form model\n\t\t\t* GenericValidatorComponent - The same as above, but allows specifying a custom type for the ValidationContext and RuleResult",
